    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、なんだか楽しそうだな\r\nいいことでもあったのか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん！　実はね、昨日お掃除してたら\r\nちっちゃい頃の甘奈が書いたお手紙を見つけたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "整理してたら懐かしいものが出てきたってやつだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん！　『大きくなった自分へ』って",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それで読んでみたらね、色んな質問があって\r\n面白かったんだ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "『今楽しくしてますか』とか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "『勉強はちゃんとしてますか』とか！\r\nそんな感じで色々！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小さい頃書いたにしては\r\nしっかりしてる質問だな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うーん、そうかな？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、でもね、変わってないな～って\r\n思うのもいくつかあったよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "『おいしいプリンを見つけたら教えてね』\r\nなんていうのもあったし",
    "charAnim1": "anger4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、可愛らしいじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でも、今と昔じゃ好みが違うかも！\r\nおススメしても『苦い～』なんて言われちゃったり？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "色々聞いてて思ったけど\r\n昔の甘奈の願い、結構叶ってるんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈もそう思う！\r\n特に『今楽しくしてますか』なんて",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "みんなとプロデューサーさんのお陰で\r\nサイッコーに叶っちゃってるもんね☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう言ってくれると嬉しいな\r\nでも、俺も甘奈たちのお陰で毎日楽しく過ごせてるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、ありがと",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、そうだ、プロデューサーさん\r\n次の予定までって、まだ時間あるよね？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、２時間くらいはあると思うぞ\r\n何かあるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、せっかくだから\r\n今の甘奈から未来の甘奈に向けて、お手紙書こうと思って",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それはいいな、ならこの辺にあるペンとかは\r\n好きに使っていいぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ありがと、プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……うーん",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014006110180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "やっぱり書き出しは\r\n『未来の自分へ……』だよね！　それから……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400611/2014006110180"
  },
